S'oossaw, ta S'oossaw,","poem":1},{"text":"taani diitsaa diis's'aade, neena sabbana.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Ta shemppattee, taani ayaw kayyottaytaa?","poem":1},{"text":"K'ay ayaw jabbakattayttaa?","poem":2},{"text":"Taani S'oossan hidootaa wotsana.","poem":1},{"text":"Ayaw gooppe, taani biro","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"taana ashshiyaawaanne ta S'oossaa galatana.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/dwr_ltw/PSA/43.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ltw/PSA/44.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/dwr_ltw/PSA/42.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}